  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Follow the Money: Strengthening Albania&#x2019;s Anti-Money Laundering Initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project addresses Albania&#x2019;s systemic gaps in money-laundering prevention and enforcement by combining watchdog journalism, stakeholder engagement, and policy analysis. It will generate independent evidence on high-risk sectors, strengthen the capacity of journalists and gatekeepers, and promote institutional dialogue to close legal and operational loopholes.</narrative>
  </description>
